SCOPE OF THIS LICENSE

The MIT terms above cover the Swift source in this repository — `Sources/`,
`Tests/`, and `Package.swift` — which is original work of the copyright holder
named above.

They do NOT cover `Frameworks/Dave.xcframework`.

That framework is a prebuilt binary archive containing third-party components,
including Discord's libdave, mlspp, and OpenSSL/libcrypto. Those components are
licensed by their own authors under their own terms. Nothing in this file
relicenses them, grants any right in them, or asserts any ownership of them.

The exact source revisions and license texts of the bundled components were not
recorded when the archive was built. THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md documents what the
checked-in artifact does and does not establish, and sets out the workflow for
capturing that information on the next framework rebuild. Until that work is
done, treat the framework's licensing as unresolved: do not infer a component's
version or license from the archive, and consult the upstream projects directly
before redistributing it.
